OL,3,GNEWSAActivists who attacked bank spared
OL,4,Ajail
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people from the Palestine Action
OL,7,Fgroup who attacked a bank in August
OL,8,F2024 have been spared immediate jail
OL,9,Fsentences.
OL,11,FThe activists were convicted of
OL,12,Fcriminal damage after covering a
OL,13,FBarclays bank in Burnley, Lancashire,
OL,14,Fwith red paint and breaking its
OL,15,Fwindows, causing about #200,000 worth
OL,16,Fof damage.
OL,18,FThe group said it had targeted Barclays
OL,19,Fover the bank's links to defence
OL,20,Fcompany Elbit Systems, which it claimed
OL,21,Fhad supplied military components used
OL,22,Fby Israel in the conflict in Gaza.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
