OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAActivists who attacked bank spared
OL,4,Ajail
OL,5,
OL,6,FHmeera Atiqnisar was given a two-year
OL,7,Fprison sentence, suspended for 20
OL,8,Fmonths. Mohammed Malik, Brendon O'Hagan
OL,9,Fand Amanda Kelly were each given
OL,10,F20-month suspended prison sentences. A
OL,11,Ffifth defendant, Alma Yaniv, will be
OL,12,Fsentenced in December.
